<title>USA: GKN says begins tender offer for Sinter shrs.</title>
<headline>GKN says begins tender offer for Sinter shrs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>GKN Plc and Sinter Metals Inc said Friday GKN's GKN Powder Metallurgy Inc has begun a tender offer for all the shares of class A and class B common stock of Sinter Metals for $37 per share.</p>
<p>The companies said this purchase is in accordance with its previously announced merger agreement.</p>
<p>The companies said said the offer and withdrawal rights will expire midnight EST, on May 30.</p>
<p>The company said Citibank NA will act as depositary for the tender, MacKenzie Partners Inc as information agent and SBC Warburg Inc will act as dealer manager.</p>
</text>
